          {"option_id": "b", "truth": "correct", "evidence": "sqrt80 uses8.944 directly; sqrt450=10sqrt4.5 gives21.21; sqrt28 uses5.292 directly; sqrt120=10sqrt1.2 gives10.95. All four source expressions and their order match."},
